<p class="lt-chem-138794">In <a title="15.4: Evaluating Quality Assurance Data" href="https://chem.libretexts.org/Bookshelves/Analytical_Chemistry/Analytical_Chemistry_2.1_(Harvey)/15%3A_Quality_Assurance/15.04%3A_Evaluating_Quality_Assurance_Data#exercise15.4.1" rel="internal">Exercise 15.4.1
</a> you created a property control chart for a glucometer. Examine your property control chart and evaluate the glucometer&rsquo;s performance. Does your conclusion change if the next three results are 255.6, 253.9, and 255.8 mg/100 mL?</p>

